  "totalBlocks": 28,
  "translatedBlocks": 25,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4d6ca5b0b1c07dd",
      "translationZh": "嗨，r/LocalLLaMA 的各位，我是 ctx 的作者，正在以我的公司 Eagle-Logic 的名义将它开源（MIT）。坦诚说明：这个仓库是我与 Claude 合作编写的。我主导了架构、图启发式策略和边跟踪，Claude 则编写了实现代码。我已经在本地运行并完善它好几个月了；欢迎试用，如果遇到任何边界情况，请告诉我！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57f2d6fe2360599d",
      "translationZh": "和你们中的很多人一样，我每天都在使用智能体编程工具。它们已经变得非常好用，但当你接近上下文上限时，那些不完善之处就会显现出来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ecf7913e96739b5",
      "translationZh": "记忆机制的实现有上千种，关于扩展上下文窗口的研究也很多。我想从另一个方向入手。我观察智能体工作时，发现它对这个用 grep，对那个用 sed，为了找一个函数读取三个文件，还把实际上不需要的上下文塞满窗口。我只是想让它直接询问某个东西在哪里。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a038b1464724a14",
      "translationZh": "于是我构建了 ctx：一个独立的 Rust 二进制程序，能将你的源码树转换为可查询的代码图。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "483e47d32fe39f45",
      "translationZh": "它内置了将仓库内容排序并整合成单个上下文块的功能（通过在依赖图上运行 PageRank，类似 aider 的 repomap），但这可能是其中最没用的部分。我构建它主要是为了支持智能体在任务进行过程中执行的查询：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0497018645f196b",
      "translationZh": "执行流程是怎么到达这里的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ab1ec7ca383df5d",
      "translationZh": "两个符号之间的最短路径？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3b012f75cec4c78",
      "translationZh": "编辑这个所需的全部信息？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8eed0812de11e3fb",
      "translationZh": "如果我修改 API，会破坏什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc60ab78e647d72b",
      "translationZh": "我的 Rust 移植版是否仍与 Python 版本保持一致？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed1050c7256a0e6f",
      "translationZh": "ctx 一致性 src.py src.rs",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46b0c6c3389db918",
      "translationZh": "$ ctx path main coverage_report # 路径：main → coverage_report（5 跳）~ 启发式推断的边（需验证）· * 分派扇出中的一个分支 crate::main [src/main.rs:439] → mcp::run [src/mcp.rs:14] → mcp::handle_method [src/mcp.rs:54] → mcp::tools_call [src/mcp.rs:163] → mcp::dispatch [src/mcp.rs:177] → query::coverage_report [src/query.rs:1420]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c50eb58ed34d9150",
      "translationZh": "在此查看完整 API 的示例：https://github.com/Eagle-Logic/context/blob/main/EXAMPLES.md",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4981fbc9c8649c81",
      "translationZh": "准确性：ctx 在自身源代码上的内部调用图召回率达到 96.2%（以可能属于内部调用的调用点为基数，计算已解析边的比例；std 和第三方 crate 不计入统计）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "744c76a0d0f529c2",
      "translationZh": "对于类型来自未求值表达式（for 绑定、迭代器链、非构造函数调用）的接收者，会回退到基于唯一名称的启发式方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17e3dd08b810d051",
      "translationZh": "尚未实现 Markdown 中从自然语言文本到代码的解析。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f634db29f05e0af",
      "translationZh": "ctx doctor 会明确指出所有这些问题，而不是将其隐藏起来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "665a7b194d84f450",
      "translationZh": "安装与速度：它使用 Tree-sitter 处理 Rust、Python、TypeScript/TSX 和 Markdown。一个图涵盖这四种语言。无需语言服务器，无需嵌入向量，也无需预热索引。图的构建耗时约 100ms（实际表现当然因情况而异），直接针对当前源代码以确定性的方式运行，而不是依赖过时的索引。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b923832bf55b00a5",
      "translationZh": "cargo install code-context # 如果你已安装 Rust brew install eagle-logic/tap/ctx # macOS",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23701d9691174349",
      "translationZh": "还提供面向 6 个平台的发行版二进制文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd25721cdb91b812",
      "translationZh": "采用 MIT 许可证。添加一种语言大约需要 500–1000 行代码（一个提取器文件，加上语法 crate），因此非常欢迎支持 Go/Java/C# 的 PR。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a72f796868f74d7",
      "translationZh": "我已经在本地用了这个工具几个月，但公开发布还是刚刚开始。如果它在你的环境中出了问题，留条评论或提个 issue，我今天就会修好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f53718158f5b0811",
      "translationZh": "ctx 的 GitHub 地址：https://github.com/Eagle-Logic/context",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a90f37ede220e9e",
      "translationZh": "编辑补充：感谢大家的反馈和提问。我昨晚成功发布了三个新版本，0.21.0 已经上线，比我最初的版本更好了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ddb2504fbc81130",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/arcandor 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
